  "method": "Built-in imagegen reference-based layer extraction/reconstruction; deterministic lossless PNG sheet division, no sprite resampling.",
  "limitations": [
    "Not original PSD layers or pixel-identical object extraction. Generated designs can differ in ornament and proportion.",
    "Occluded wall/stair/cabinet edges and skyline/floor modules are reconstructed.",
    "Existing room_201 three-state asset is unchanged; these floor-derived doors are separate static sprites, not new state animations.",
    "No characters, dirt stain, registration desk or new exit sign generated. Stairs are the visible travel portals.",
    "Illumination and shading inside the painted object are baked; external FX are separately controllable."
  ],
